  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning for Out-of-School Youth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">&#xc9;ducation de base</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">L&apos;agriculture est la science et la pratique de la production de denr&#xe9;es alimentaires, d&apos;aliments pour animaux et de fibres (y compris la foresterie, la faune, la p&#xea;che, l&apos;aquaculture et la floriculture) et ses relations avec les ressources naturelles, la transformation, la commercialisation, la distribution, l&apos;utilisation (y compris la nutrition) et le commerce.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the activity is to increase safe and equitable non-formal learning opportunities for out-of-school youth to develop the foundational or vocational skills needed to transition into formal education or employment.</narrative>
  </description>
